PROFILE aql:contract/v1
VERSION 1
CONTRACT evolution-agent-development-default
DELEGATED_BY organization:constitutional-authority
PRINCIPAL bot:evolution-agent

ALLOW MODEL openrouter
ALLOW OQL *

ALLOW URI_PROCESS repo://workspace/*
ALLOW URI_PROCESS process://workspace/*
ALLOW URI_PROCESS process://twin/*
ALLOW URI_PROCESS cad://openscad/*
ALLOW URI_PROCESS http://live-app:8787/*
ALLOW URI_PROCESS vault://workspace/secret/*

ALLOW ACCESS ROTATE secret:*
ALLOW VARIABLE WRITE secret-ref:*
LIMIT STEPS 20
LIMIT EXECUTIONS 1000
REQUIRE EVIDENCE_BUNDLE true
REQUIRE HUMAN_APPROVAL authority-change
EXPIRES 2030-01-01T00:00:00Z
